// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <locale/keys_pt_abnt2.h>
#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

&lt {
    flavor = "balanced";
    tapping-term-ms = <300>;
    quick-tap-ms = <250>;
    require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
};

&sk { quick-release; };

/ {
    behaviors {
        mm_bspc_del: mm_bspc_del {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_BSPC_DEL";
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>, <&kp DELETE>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        lt_bspc_r: lt_bspc_r {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "LT_BSPC_R";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&mm_bspc_del>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <10 11 12 13 21 22 23 24 16 17 18 19 0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34>;
        };

        hrm_l: homerow_mod_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_LEFT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <31 9 19 30 8 18 29 7 17 28 6 16 27 5 15 26 37 36 35 13 12 11 10 32 34 33>;
        };

        hrm_r: homerow_mod_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_RIGHT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34 34 16 17 18 19 35 36 37>;
        };

        hrm_l_hwu: homerow_mod_left_hwu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_LEFT_HWU";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <31 9 19 30 8 18 29 7 17 28 6 16 27 5 15 26 37 36 35 13 12 11 10 32 33 34>;
        };

        hrm_r_hwu: homerow_mod_right_hwu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_RIGHT_HWU";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34 34 35 36 37 16 17 18 19>;
        };

        sl_mo_l: sticky_layer_momentary_layer_l {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "STICKY_LAYER_MOMENTARY_LAYER_L";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&sl>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <35 36 37 5 15 26 6 16 27 7 17 28 8 18 29 9 19 30 31 13 12 11 10 32 33 34>;
        };

        sl_mo_r: sticky_layer_momentary_layer_r {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "STICK_LAYER_MOMENTARY_LAYER_R";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&sl>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <13 12 11 10 32 33 34 0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 22 23 24 25 21 35 36 37 16 17 18 19>;
        };

        sk_mo_l: stick_key_momentary_layer_l {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "STICKY_KEY_MOMENTARY_LAYER_L";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&sk>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <10 11 12 13 32 33 34 10 11 12 13 14 32 33 35 36 37 16 17 18 19 5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37>;
        };

        sk_mo_r: sticky_key_momentary_layer_r {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "STICKY_KEY_MOMENTARY_LAYER_R";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&sk>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <10 11 12 13 32 33 34 0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 35 36 37 16 17 18 19>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Hold-Tap keys
        // ==========================================

        ht_dot: ht_dot {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_dot_sft &kp>;
        };

        ht_comma: ht_comma {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_comma_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_qmark: ht_qmark {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_qmark_sft &kp>;
        };

        ht_excl: ht_excl {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_excl_sft &kp>;
        };

        ht_star: ht_star {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_star_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_fslh: ht_fslh {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_fslh_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_prcnt: ht_prcnt {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_prcnt_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_dllr: ht_dllr {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_brl_spc &kp>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Hold-Tap-Dance keys
        // ==========================================
        // Smart Equal

        ht_eq_1: ht_eq_1 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_eq_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_eq_2: ht_eq_2 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_neq_spc &mac_eqeq_spc>;
        };

        htd_eq: htd_eq {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&ht_eq_1 0 PT_EQUAL>, <&ht_eq_2 0 0>;
        };

        // Smart Greater Than

        ht_gt_1: ht_gt_1 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_gt_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_gt_2: ht_gt_2 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_gte_spc &mac_gtgt>;
        };

        htd_gt: htd_gt {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&ht_gt_1 0 GT>, <&ht_gt_2 0 0>;
        };

        // Smart Less Than

        ht_lt_1: ht_lt_1 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_lt_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_lt_2: ht_lt_2 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_lte_spc &mac_ltlt>;
        };

        htd_lt: htd_lt {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&ht_lt_1 0 LT>, <&ht_lt_2 0 0>;
        };

        // Smart Plus

        ht_plus_1: ht_plus_1 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_plus_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_plus_2: ht_plus_2 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_plus_eq_spc>, <&mac_plus_plus>;
        };

        htd_plus: htd_plus {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&ht_plus_1 0 PLUS>, <&ht_plus_2 0 0>;
        };

        // Smart Minus

        ht_minus_1: ht_minus_1 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_minus_spc &kp>;
        };

        ht_minus_2: ht_minus_2 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            bindings = <&mac_minus_eq_spc>, <&mac_minus_minus>;
        };

        htd_minus: htd_minus {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&ht_minus_1 0 MINUS>, <&ht_minus_2 0 0>;
        };

        mm_dot_gt: mm_dot_gt {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            bindings = <&ht_dot 0 DOT>, <&htd_gt>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_comma_lt: mm_comma_lt {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            bindings = <&ht_comma 0 COMMA>, <&htd_lt>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Mod-Morphs for Accented Letters
        // ==========================================

        mm_a_acute: mm_a_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_a_acute>, <&mac_a_acute_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_a_tilde: mm_a_tilde {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_a_tilde>, <&mac_a_tilde_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_a_caret: mm_a_caret {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_a_caret>, <&mac_a_caret_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_a_grave: mm_a_grave {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_a_grave>, <&mac_a_grave_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_e_acute: mm_e_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_e_acute>, <&mac_e_acute_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_e_caret: mm_e_caret {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_e_caret>, <&mac_e_caret_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_o_acute: mm_o_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_o_acute>, <&mac_o_acute_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_o_tilde: mm_o_tilde {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_o_tilde>, <&mac_o_tilde_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_o_caret: mm_o_caret {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_o_caret>, <&mac_o_caret_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_i_acute: mm_i_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_i_acute>, <&mac_i_acute_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Mod-Morphs for Bigrams
        // ==========================================

        mm_ao: mm_ao {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_ao>, <&mac_ao_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_oes: mm_oes {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_oes>, <&mac_oes_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_ue: mm_ue {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_ue>, <&mac_ue_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_gu: mm_gu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_gu>, <&mac_gu_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_qu: mm_qu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&mac_qu>, <&mac_qu_up>;

            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };
    };

    macros {
        os_focus_notification: os_dismiss_notification {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LG(R)>;
            label = "OS_DISMISS_NOTIFICATION";
        };

        os_end_session: os_end_session {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(DELETE))>;
            label = "OS_END_SESSION";
        };

        os_lock_screen: os_lock_screen {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(BACKSPACE))>;
            label = "OS_LOCK_SCREEN";
        };

        txt_assignment: txt_assignment {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_ASSIGNMENT";
        };

        txt_equals: txt_equals {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_EQUALS";
        };

        txt_nequals: txt_nequals {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EXCL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_NEQUALS";
        };

        // Macros for Hold-Tap keys

        mac_dot_sft: mac_dot_sft {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp DOT &kp SPACE &sk LEFT_SHIFT>;
        };

        mac_comma_spc: mac_comma_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp COMMA &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_qmark_sft: mac_qmark_sft {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp QMARK &kp SPACE &sk LEFT_SHIFT>;
        };

        mac_excl_sft: mac_excl_sft {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp EXCL &kp SPACE &sk LEFT_SHIFT>;
        };

        mac_star_spc: mac_star_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp STAR &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_fslh_spc: mac_fslh_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp PT_FSLH &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_prcnt_spc: mac_prcnt_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PRCNT &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_brl_spc: mac_brl_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp R &kp DLLR &kp SPACE>;
        };

        // Macros for Hold-Tap-Dance keys

        mac_eq_spc: mac_eq_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_eqeq_spc: mac_eqeq_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_neq_spc: mac_neq_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp EXCL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_gt_spc: mac_gt_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp GT &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_gtgt: mac_gtgt {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp GT &kp GT>;
        };

        mac_gte_spc: mac_gte_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp GT &kp PT_EQUAL &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_lt_spc: mac_lt_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp LT &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_ltlt: mac_ltlt {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LT &kp LT>;
        };

        mac_lte_spc: mac_lte_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp LT &kp PT_EQUAL &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_plus_spc: mac_plus_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp PLUS &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_plus_plus: mac_plusplus_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PLUS &kp PLUS>;
        };

        mac_plus_eq_spc: mac_plus_eq_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp PLUS &kp PT_EQUAL &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_minus_spc: mac_minus_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp MINUS &kp SPACE>;
        };

        mac_minus_minus: mac_mimi_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp MINUS &kp MINUS>;
        };

        mac_minus_eq_spc: mac_minus_eq_spc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SPACE &kp MINUS &kp PT_EQUAL &kp SPACE>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Accented Vowels (A)
        // ==========================================

        mac_a_acute: mac_a_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp A>;
        };

        mac_a_acute_up: mac_a_acute_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp LS(A)>;
        };

        mac_a_tilde: mac_a_tilde {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp A>;
        };

        mac_a_tilde_up: mac_a_tilde_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp LS(A)>;
        };

        mac_a_caret: mac_a_caret {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_CARET &kp A>;
        };

        mac_a_caret_up: mac_a_caret_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_CARET &kp LS(A)>;
        };

        mac_a_grave: mac_a_grave {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_GRAVE &kp A>;
        };

        mac_a_grave_up: mac_a_grave_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_GRAVE &kp LS(A)>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Accented Vowels (E)
        // ==========================================

        mac_e_acute: mac_e_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp E>;
        };

        mac_e_acute_up: mac_e_acute_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp LS(E)>;
        };

        mac_e_caret: mac_e_caret {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_CARET &kp E>;
        };

        mac_e_caret_up: mac_e_caret_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_CARET &kp LS(E)>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Accented Vowels (O)
        // ==========================================

        mac_o_acute: mac_o_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp O>;
        };

        mac_o_acute_up: mac_o_acute_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp LS(O)>;
        };

        mac_o_tilde: mac_o_tilde {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp O>;
        };

        mac_o_tilde_up: mac_o_tilde_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp LS(O)>;
        };

        mac_o_caret: mac_o_caret {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_CARET &kp O>;
        };

        mac_o_caret_up: mac_o_caret_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_CARET &kp LS(O)>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Accented Vowels (I)
        // ==========================================

        mac_i_acute: mac_i_acute {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp I>;
        };

        mac_i_acute_up: mac_i_acute_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_ACUTE &kp LS(I)>;
        };

        // ==========================================
        // Bigram Macros (ão, ões, ue, gu, qu)
        // ==========================================

        mac_ao: mac_ao {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp A &kp O>;
        };

        mac_ao_up: mac_ao_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp LS(A) &kp O>;
        };

        mac_oes: mac_oes {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp O &kp E &kp S>;
        };

        mac_oes_up: mac_oes_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_TILDE &kp LS(O) &kp E &kp S>;
        };

        mac_ue: mac_ue {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp U &kp E>;
        };

        mac_ue_up: mac_ue_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LS(U) &kp E>;
        };

        mac_gu: mac_gu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp G &kp U>;
        };

        mac_gu_up: mac_gu_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LS(G) &kp U>;
        };

        mac_qu: mac_qu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp Q &kp U>;
        };

        mac_qu_up: mac_qu_up {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LS(Q) &kp U>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        left_sk_shift {
            bindings = <&sk LSHIFT>;
            key-positions = <13 12>;
        };

        right_esc {
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
        &kp Q          &kp W              &kp E           &kp R                &kp T                     &kp Y                   &kp U                &kp I                  &kp O              &kp P
        &hrm_l LGUI A  &hrm_l LEFT_ALT S  &hrm_l LCTRL D  &hrm_l LEFT_SHIFT F  &hrm_l LA(LG(LCTRL)) G    &hrm_r LA(LG(LCTRL)) H  &hrm_r LEFT_SHIFT J  &hrm_r LEFT_CONTROL K  &hrm_r LEFT_ALT L  &hrm_r LGUI PT_SEMI
&kp AT  &kp Z          &kp X              &kp C           &kp V                &kp B                     &kp N                   &kp M                &mm_comma_lt           &mm_dot_gt         &ht_fslh 0 PT_FSLH   &ht_excl 0 EXCL
                                          &sl_mo_l 5 7    &lt 1 SPACE          &lt 3 TAB                 &lt 4 ENTER             &lt_bspc_r 2 0       &sl_mo_r 6 7
            >;
        };

        navigation {
            bindings = <
                &kp LC(N0)            &kp LC(MINUS)            &kp LC(PLUS)                   &kp LC(EQUAL)          &none    &os_focus_notification  &kp LG(NUMBER_1)        &kp LG(N2)              &kp LG(N3)             &kp LG(NUMBER_4)
                &hrm_l LEFT_GUI HOME  &hrm_l LEFT_ALT PAGE_UP  &hrm_l LEFT_CONTROL PAGE_DOWN  &hrm_l LEFT_SHIFT END  &none    &kp LEFT_ARROW          &hrm_r LEFT_SHIFT DOWN  &hrm_r LEFT_CONTROL UP  &hrm_r LEFT_ALT RIGHT  &hrm_r LEFT_GUI PRINTSCREEN
&studio_unlock  &none                 &none                    &none                          &none                  &none    &kp CAPSLOCK            &kp LC(TAB)             &kp LA(TAB)             &kp LG(TAB)            &kp LG(ESC)                  &os_end_session
                                                               &none                          &none                  &none    &caps_word              &kp K_MENU              &none
            >;
        };

        symbols {
            bindings = <
             &ht_dllr 0 DLLR       &ht_prcnt 0 PRCNT  &kp PT_LBRC       &kp PT_RBRC  &kp AMPS       &none  &none         &none        &none  &none
             &kp LS(RA(PT_ACUTE))  &kp PT_DQT         &kp LPAR          &kp RPAR     &kp HASH       &none  &kp PT_COLON  &kp PT_FSLH  &none  &none
&kp PT_BSLH  &kp LS(RA(PT_TILDE))  &kp RA(PT_TILDE)   &kp PT_LBKT       &kp PT_RBKT  &kp PT_PIPE    &none  &none         &none        &none  &none  &none
                                                      &kp RA(PT_ACUTE)  &kp UNDER    &kp PT_SQT     &none  &none         &none
            >;
        };

        numbers {
            bindings = <
       &none                    &none                 &none                      &none                   &none    &htd_plus        &kp N1  &kp N2  &kp N3  &mm_comma_lt
       &hrm_l LEFT_GUI PT_FSLH  &hrm_l LEFT_ALT STAR  &hrm_l LEFT_CONTROL MINUS  &hrm_l LEFT_SHIFT PLUS  &none    &htd_minus       &kp N4  &kp N5  &kp N6  &mm_dot_gt
&none  &none                    &none                 &none                      &none                   &none    &ht_star 0 STAR  &kp N7  &kp N8  &kp N9  &ht_fslh 0 PT_FSLH  &kp UNDER
                                                      &none                      &none                   &none    &htd_eq          &kp N0  &none
            >;
        };

        launchers {
            bindings = <
       &none       &none       &none       &none       &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
       &kp LG(N4)  &kp LG(N3)  &kp LG(N2)  &kp LG(N1)  &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&none  &none       &none       &none       &none       &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
                               &none       &kp LG(N5)  &none    &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };

        function {
            bindings = <
       &none         &none         &none             &none           &none    &none  &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F10
       &kp LEFT_GUI  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp LEFT_CONTROL  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &none    &none  &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &kp F11
&none  &none         &none         &none             &none           &none    &none  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &kp F12  &none
                                   &none             &none           &none    &none  &none   &none
            >;
        };

        media {
            bindings = <
            &kp C_REWIND  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &kp C_FAST_FORWARD  &none           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
            &kp C_PREV    &kp C_VOL_DN          &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &kp C_NEXT          &none           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&bt BT_CLR  &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1          &bt BT_SEL 2          &bt BT_SEL 3        &bt BT_SEL 4    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &studio_unlock
                                                &kp C_STOP            &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE    &kp K_MUTE      &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };

        accents {
            bindings = <
       &none        &mm_e_caret  &mm_e_acute       &none        &none    &none  &none        &mm_i_acute  &mm_o_acute  &mm_o_tilde
       &mm_a_grave  &mm_a_caret  &mm_a_tilde       &mm_a_acute  &none    &none  &mm_o_caret  &mm_ao       &mm_oes      &kp GRAVE
&none  &none        &none        &kp PT_C_CEDILLA  &none        &none    &none  &none        &none        &none        &none        &none
                                 &none             &none        &none    &none  &none        &none
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers { compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers"; };
};
